# Your crontab for The Short Fuse. Install it with:
#   crontab ~/lab/cert-fuse/renew.cron
# That replaces your whole crontab; `crontab -l` shows what is installed.
#
# Fields: minute  hour  day-of-month  month  day-of-week  command
# Cron runs with almost none of your shell's environment: use full paths,
# and send the output to a log file you can read.
